class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f6</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f6</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">inline</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f8</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f7</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f7</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">inline</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f9</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f8</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f8</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">inline</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f9</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f9</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">inline</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f11</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">inline</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f12</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f11</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f11</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">inline</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f13</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f12</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f12</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">inline</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f14</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f13</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f13</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">inline</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f15</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\